    "star": true,
    "section": "根据定义求导",
    "problem": "求 $f(x)=\\sqrt{x}$ 的导数（$x>0$）。",
    "answer": [
      "由定义，$f'(x)=\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}\\dfrac{\\sqrt{x+\\Delta x}-\\sqrt{x}}{\\Delta x}$。",
      "分子、分母同乘 $\\sqrt{x+\\Delta x}+\\sqrt{x}$，得",
      "$f'(x)=\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}\\dfrac1{\\sqrt{x+\\Delta x}+\\sqrt{x}}=\\dfrac1{2\\sqrt{x}}$。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "number": 2,
    "star": true,
    "section": "根据定义求导",
    "problem": "求 $f(x)=\\dfrac1x$ 的导数（$x\\ne0$）。",
    "answer": [
      "由定义，$f'(x)=\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}\\dfrac{\\dfrac{1}{x+\\Delta x}-\\dfrac{1}{x}}{\\Delta x}$。",
      "通分并约去 $\\Delta x$，得",
      "$f'(x)=\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}\\dfrac{-1}{x(x+\\Delta x)}=-\\dfrac1{x^2}$。"
    ]
  },
